    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_b_mob_01",
      "hash64": "A1B05DAE8A2F91DC",
      "text": "那個，妳是妮莫……對吧？\\n就是那個學生會長……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_b_02",
      "hash64": "3202DDDC48366F42",
      "text": "嗯，是呀！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
